    source: "MarketWatch",
    sourceUrl: "https://www.marketwatch.com/story/has-the-tech-bubble-burst-why-the-nasdaqs-rough-ride-looks-eerily-like-2000-5bcefcb2?mod=mw_rss_topstories",
